  "content": "<div>这个月初给自己定了目标：“获得稳定供应新词的能力”。</div>\n<div>月中到处求贤问道，感觉终于有了一点小成，浓缩成下面这张表格，分享给大家。</div>\n<div>把下面的表格复制到一个新文档，然后每天上班按部就班地填，就是一个找词的流程了。</div>\n<div>词找词，词找站，站找词，都是可以联动的。明白了怎么联动，词就找不完了。</div>\n<div>下面就演示了一个联动的过程：</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://s.web.cafe/image/00f31c4bede84c65ad5bf11940cf1926.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<hr class=\"h-2 my-2\">\n<div>接下来的内容复制到一个新文档，就可以直接开干了。</div>\n<hr class=\"h-2 my-2\">\n<div>口诀：词找词（Google Trend）、词找站（谷歌搜索、whois）、站找词（AITDK）、站找站（ahrefs backlink checker、首页出站链接）</div>\n<div><a href=\"https://new.web.cafe/topic/60wmnukjzg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">哥飞找词思路汇总(截止20250625) | Web.Cafe</a></div>\n<h1 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 2rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">词找词</h1>\n<div>到 google trends 里面看 7 天相关查询。</div>\n<div>词根（这里是 Trendsbar 默认词根，你有积累之后换成你自己的）：</div>\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: initial; display: block; border: none;\"><code class=\"language-Plain\" style=\"white-space: pre; color: black; background: none; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none;\"><span>Translator,Generator,Example,Convert,Online\n</span>Downloader,Maker,Creator,Editor,Processor\nDesigner,Compiler,Analyzer,Evaluator,Sender\nReceiver,Interpreter,Uploader,Calculator,Sample\nTemplate,Format,Builder,Scheme,Pattern\nChecker,Detector,Scraper,Manager,Explorer\nDashboard,Planner,Tracker,Recorder,Optimizer\nScheduler,Converter,Viewer,Extractor,Monitor\nNotifier,Verifier,Simulator,Assistant,Constructor\nComparator,Navigator,Syncer,Connector,Cataloger\nResponder</code></div></pre>\n<div>参考词：</div>\n<ul>\n<li>gpts 5K</li>\n</ul>\n<div>本月我的词根（下个月表现好的加入到上面的总词根）：</div>\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: initial; display: block; border: none;\"><code class=\"language-Plain\" style=\"white-space: pre; color: black; background: none; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none;\"><span>higgsfield ai\n</span>changer\n... 以及你找到的可以用的关键词。</code></div></pre>\n<ul>\n<li>如果某个词下面的相关查询信息量大，把它加入到本月的词根观察。</li>\n</ul>\n<table><thead><tr><th>来源词根</th><th>关键词</th><th>标签</th><th>Google Trends 每日流量</th><th>allintitle</th><th>备注</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>higgsfield ai</td><td>earth zoom out</td><td>新词，适合内页</td><td>5K</td><td>900</td><td></td></tr><tr><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h1 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 2rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">词找站</h1>\n<div>直接谷歌搜，看排在前几的站。</div>\n<ul>\n<li>新词站，可以找他的新鲜外链</li>\n<li>大站，可以进入站找词流程</li>\n</ul>\n<table><thead><tr><th>关键词</th><th>网站</th><th>标签</th><th>备注</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>earth zoom out</td><td><a href=\"https://www.media.io/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.media.io/</a></td><td>all in one，视频站</td><td></td></tr><tr><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h1 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 2rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">站找词</h1>\n<div><a href=\"https://new.web.cafe/tutorial/detail/mrozYpTgfu6MGXggeX2Kzr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">再聊挖掘需求的方法 | Web.Cafe</a></div>\n<div>看 semrush 感觉比较好，信息比较全。</div>\n<ul>\n<li>大站，看有流量，难度低的词，可以进入词找站流程。</li>\n<li>经常出现感觉可以做词根的，就放到词找词里面确认一下，合适就加入。</li>\n</ul>\n<table><thead><tr><th>网站</th><th>关键词</th><th>标签</th><th>GT 每日流量</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href=\"https://www.media.io/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.media.io/</a></td><td>ai clothes changer</td><td>需求词</td><td>1K</td></tr><tr><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table>",
